The images in this folder (the Type icons) are Pokémon game type icons. Pokémon and Pokémon images
are © Nintendo, Creatures, GAME FREAK and The Pokémon Company. MyVGC is not affiliated with them.

The images are not covered by MyVGC's licence, the GNU AGPL v3. No licence to them is granted here.

They come from the Champions small type icons in PokeAPI's sprites repository
(https://github.com/PokeAPI/sprites), resized to 48 × 48 and converted to WebP by
`pnpm sprites:update`. The pinned commit is in packages/core/src/sprites.ts and the table of files
(TYPE_ICON_NUMBERS) in packages/core/src/icons.ts. See
docs/adr/0032-item-icons-and-type-icons-from-pokeapi.md.
